{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildcard is a\u00a0 2v2 Collectible Card Action Game where strategy and skill collide. Choose your champion, craft decks, cast summons, &amp; battle for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/4717afacd3f93c3c395597e4a332e60d.poster.avif?t=1760365011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/4717afacd3f93c3c395597e4a332e60d.webm?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/4717afacd3f93c3c395597e4a332e60d.mp4?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Key Game Features:</u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deck Building</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck is what a player brings into a match to use with the champions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Decks include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 summons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Wild Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 3 Talents</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Champions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A player controlled character from the 3rd person point of view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champions all have unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champions charge ultimates over time and use their passive ability effectively to do what they do best, such as using fire, dealing damage, or collecting scrap.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>265 Summons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures that assist the champions in winning the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each summon has a different role on the team via stats and abilities they have</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/bf722605217778edfa9dd777fcaad5b7.poster.avif?t=1760365011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/bf722605217778edfa9dd777fcaad5b7.webm?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/bf722605217778edfa9dd777fcaad5b7.mp4?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>13 Wild Cards</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In match temporary power ups a player can acquire</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>36 Talents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades for champions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2v2 Game Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Field Layouts per arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has 2 champions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players fight and use summons to take down the other teams goalie and break the core to score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Cards spawn in the arenas as temporary power ups<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/e959eb9d36ac66b3fa58140ca2dc1190.poster.avif?t=1760365011\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/e959eb9d36ac66b3fa58140ca2dc1190.webm?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/e959eb9d36ac66b3fa58140ca2dc1190.mp4?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenges</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily challenges to earn Fame and Battle Pass Tokens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get wins each day and week to earn Fame and Battle Pass Tokens</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alpha Battle Pass</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Battle Pass Tokens to unlock Summons, Talents, Wild Cards and 10 unique Alpha Cosmetics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The speed for the Battle Pass during Alpha is accelerated</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Packs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Fame to open packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packs will unlock other Summons to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any duplicate card pull will result in Vault XP or Fortune depending on the rarity of the card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/2dfb6ae4d164f812165877dfc2cc29cc.poster.avif?t=1760365011\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/2dfb6ae4d164f812165877dfc2cc29cc.webm?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029050/extras/2dfb6ae4d164f812165877dfc2cc29cc.mp4?t=1760365011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029050?t=1760365011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite